<para>
  <classname>Magnitude</classname> is one of the <link
  linkend="RegisteredClass-Invariant"><classname>Invariants</classname></link>
  of a vector quantity that can be computed by the &oof2; <link
  linkend="Section-Output"><classname>Outputs</classname></link>.  The
  magnitude of a vector or tensor is the square root of the sum of the
  squares of its components (L2 norm).
</para>
  


